  <!-- EN: ODC Duelist Armor(Raven) -->
  <ODC_Armor_Duelist_Jump.label>ODC决斗者护甲（渡鸦）</ODC_Armor_Duelist_Jump.label>
  <!-- EN: Moded power armor, good protects the owner. Designed for use by Obsidia Drifters.\n\nDuelist version improves melee skills to the owner.\n\nModified with the addition of a Jump pack. -->
  <ODC_Armor_Duelist_Jump.description>改装动力护甲，良好地保护穿戴者。专为黑曜石漂泊者设计。\n\n决斗者版本提高穿戴者的近战技能。\n\n增加了跳跃背包的改良版本。</ODC_Armor_Duelist_Jump.description>
  <!-- EN: jump -->
  <ODC_Armor_Duelist_Jump.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>跳跃</ODC_Armor_Duelist_Jump.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
